 strip debug symbols). This is why `!debug` is set in options.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- Install prefix `/usr` \u2014 standard system location\n- `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` \u2014 put libraries in `/usr/lib` (not `/usr/lib64`, which"}